// words truncated. Measured off a canvas with .n-title's exact font, so it is a
// pure function of the title text — no DOM, no render-order coupling, and
// nodeWidth stays the single source every consumer already reads (endpointAnchor,
// applyNodeSize, the edge geometry). nodeCenter deliberately keeps the NODE_W
// constant, so widening a card never moves it in or out of a group.
//
// Sized for the QUIET head, and therefore ONLY active while Clean cards is on.
// With Clean cards off the four head buttons stay put and eat ~249px of a card,
